      "cooked": "<p>Hello, all!</p>\n<p>Below is a poll I made to poll which minor games made by GTG folks own/play. A “minor game” is defined as any game whose Forum is in the <a class=\"hashtag\" href=\"/c/other-games/43\">#<span>other-games</span></a> category, rather than the <a class=\"hashtag\" href=\"/c/games/73\">#<span>games</span></a> category, which is pretty much everything other than <em>Spirit Island</em> and most of the Sentinel Comics games.</p>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-max=\"7\" data-poll-min=\"1\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-charttype=\"bar\" data-poll-type=\"multiple\" data-poll-name=\"poll\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<div class=\"poll-title\">Minor Games Poll</div>\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"630cbf2e3627b431132ad701da1703e2\">Bottom of the 9th</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"e044a0a38832abebf2ed7222b3ce1da1\">Any Dice Hate Me games</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"3c921ca52268a5a810f0c43832fec7a4\">Exoplanets</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"84b295a65411529b801f3bbc1024f1a4\">Fate of the Elder Gods</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"8bf8e98cf2fae63f0f1f88c7cc51e316\">Galactic Strike Force</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"2ee9535905d11486a7e385dc12d57614\">Lazer Ryderz</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"c820e2133bef3b2b0ffe6c183b060ff9\">Sentinel Tactics</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<p>\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
