      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"28739\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Now Bottom of the 9th…tiny game, super fun! It also works great as a spectator game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I really agree with this.</p>\n<p>It’s pretty fun on digital now and then, Handelabra did a great job with it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
